  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/775/white-rhino-gif-logo.gif\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個模組將白犀牛加入遊戲，為稀樹草原生態域增添更多生機。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果牠們受到傷害，就會立刻變得具有攻擊性，或者當附近有小犀牛時也會如此。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們會先衝向目標，造成傷害並將實體撞飛到空中。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">衝刺攻擊結束後，牠們的移動速度會變慢。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">馴服牠們十分困難，每次餵食只有10%的機率成功。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">即使被馴服，牠們也不會跟隨你，也無法讓牠們坐下，</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">但只要你靠近牠們，牠們就會對攻擊主人的目標（孩童除外）表現出攻擊性。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">雌性比雄性體型小，且只有雄性和雌性才能繁殖。</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">食物物品的標籤JSON檔案可以在data-&gt;tags-&gt;item資料夾中找到。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">目前該清單中僅有小麥。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">當牠們從地面吃草時，會恢復一些生命值。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">雌性（75點生命值）體型較小，生命值比雄性（100點）少，而幼年個體的生命值更少（25點）。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們的角會隨機生長，角越長，造成的傷害越高，最高可達12點。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們也會掉落皮革和骨頭。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以在稀樹草原生態域中找到牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">（在Forge和NeoForge中，你可以透過編輯data-&gt;biome tags和biome modifier資料夾中的JSON檔案，或使用資源包來更改生成設定；在Fabric中則有專門的設定檔。）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組目前支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x | 1.21.x</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>如果你需要其他版本的模組，或在CurseForge上遇到任何錯誤，請發送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝AquariusLibs才能運作</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/779/growing-horn-size-randomly.gif\"></span></p>",
